pository: this is new build work\"\n   ],\n   \"span\": \"I-7\"\n  }\n ]\n}\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"sketches\" kind=\"sketches\" sha=\"\">\n[]\n</artifact>\n\n<artifact id=\"differences\" kind=\"differences\" sha=\"\">\n[\n {\n  \"id\": \"D-1\",\n  \"readings\": [\n   {\n    \"behaviour\": 2,\n    \"sketch\": 2,\n    \"summary\": \"Button shows confirmation/success feedback once the email is dispatched (no specific double-send prevention mentioned)\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"behaviour\": 5,\n    \"sketch\": 3,\n    \"summary\": \"Double-clicking / repeated presses do not send duplicate reminders in a single action (button disabled during send)\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"span\": \"I-2\",\n  \"topic\": \"Double-send prevention mechanism\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"D-2\",\n  \"readings\": [\n   {\n    \"behaviour\": 0,\n    \"sketch\": 1,\n    \"summary\": \"Each reminder sent is recorded with the staff user who sent it and a timestamp (no immutability requirement stated)\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"behaviour\": 2,\n    \"sketch\": 2,\n    \"summary\": \"History records are immutable (cannot be edited or deleted by staff)\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"span\": \"I-3\",\n  \"topic\": \"Reminder history immutability\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"D-3\",\n  \"readings\": [\n   {\n    \"behaviour\": 3,\n    \"sketch\": 2,\n    \"summary\": \"Clicking a row/invoice navigates to the invoice detail screen (I-7)\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"behaviour\": 3,\n    \"sketch\": 3,\n    \"summary\": \"Clicking an invoice row/number navigates to that invoice's detail screen\"\n   }\n  ],\n  \"span\": \"I-6\",\n  \"topic\": \"Navigation from overdue list to invoice detail\"\n },\n {\n  \"id\": \"D-4\",\n  \"readings\": [\n   {\n    \"behaviour\": 0,\n    \"sketch\": 2,\n    \"summary\": \"Invoice detail screen displays invoice amount and due date (no send reminder action mentioned)\"\n   },\n   {\n    \"behaviour\": 3,\n    \"sketch\": 3,\n    \"summary\": \"Screen includes a 'Send reminder' action if the invoice is currently